","title":"DeepSeek融资70亿美元创纪录，创始人个人出资30亿","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-05-10T00:00:00.605Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmoxlrdbd02oxsllh4y7eupuv","https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2052901878728659037"],"articles":[{"id":"cmoxlrdbd02oxsllh4y7eupuv","title":"DeepSeek融资70亿美元创纪录，创始人个人出资30亿","originalTitle":"","summary":"DeepSeek正以500亿美元估值进行高达70亿美元的融资，创下中国AI领域最大单轮融资纪录。创始人梁文锋个人出资30亿美元，占本轮融资的40%，同时仍保留公司90%的所有权。该公司最初诞生于其本人成功的对冲基金内部。本轮融资将主要用于获取大规模计算资源，以加速发布V4.1等新模型，并投资企业级产品，目标是推动公司实现营收转正，其发展路径与OpenAI和Anthropic类似。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmoxlrdbd02oxsllh4y7eupuv","originalUrl":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2052901878728659037","publishedAt":"2026-05-10T00:00:00.605Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1sngkqe","originalSourceName":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","family":"outlet-1lanm2l","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmoxlrdbd02oxsllh4y7eupuv","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T10:49:04.201Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1sngkqe","name":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T10:49:04.201Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"DeepSeek正以500亿美元估值进行高达70亿美元的融资，创下中国AI领域最大单轮融资纪录。创始人梁文锋个人出资30亿美元，占本轮融资的40%，同时仍保留公司90%的所有权。该公司最初诞生于其本人成功的对冲基金内部。本轮融资将主要用于获取大规模计算资源，以加速发布V4.1等新模型，并投资企业级产品，目标是推动公司实现营收转正，其发展路径与OpenAI和Anthropic类似。","reportEdition":"2026-05-10","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmoy5azwm078gsllhyueu5wzp","title":"工信部启动人工智能科技伦理审查与服务先导计划，加快推动审查工作落地实施","topic":"行业","publishedAt":"2026-05-10T00:00:00.605Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmoy5azwm078gsllhyueu5wzp","https://www.ithome.com/0/948/246.htm"],"articles":[{"id":"cmoy5azwm078gsllhyueu5wzp","title":"工信部启动人工智能科技伦理审查与服务先导计划，加快推动审查工作落地实施","originalTitle":"","summary":"工业和信息化部近日启动人工智能科技伦理审查与服务先导计划，旨在依托国家人工智能产业创新应用先导区，探索审查服务的落地路径与协同治理机制。该计划部署了四项重点任务：细化省级伦理审查制度、指导创新主体建设伦理委员会、开展审查实践与标准研制、构建部省市三级联动治理网络。同时，将设立全国伦理风险监测服务网络，编制培训教材并开设“伦理课堂”，以提供智力支持，推动人工智能负责任创新和产业高质量发展。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmoy5azwm078gsllhyueu5wzp","originalUrl":"https://www.ithome.com/0/948/246.htm","publishedAt":"2026-05-10T00:00:00.605Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-23t2ho","originalSourceName":"IT之家·人工智能","family":"outlet-115kagi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"行业动态","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmoy5azwm078gsllhyueu5wzp","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T10:49:04.201Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-23t2ho","name":"IT之家·人工智能","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T10:49:04.201Z"}],"sectionLabel":"行业动态","reportSummary":"工业和信息化部近日启动人工智能科技伦理审查与服务先导计划，旨在依托国家人工智能产业创新应用先导区，探索审查服务的落地路径与协同治理机制。该计划部署了四项重点任务：细化省级伦理审查制度、指导创新主体建设伦理委员会、开展审查实践与标准研制、构建部省市三级联动治理网络。同时，将设立全国伦理风险监测服务网络，编制培训教材并开设“伦理课堂”，以提供智力支持，推动人工智能负责任创新和产业高质量发展。","reportEdition":"2026-05-10","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmoxu9rbt04o8sllhs72a1f6c","title":"Hermes Agent登顶OpenRouter全球令牌排名","topic"