phd-level-math-research-in-under-two-hours-with-zero-human-help"],"articles":[{"id":"cmoyh118d09uqsllhfwv7ggxu","title":"菲尔兹奖得主称 ChatGPT 5.5 Pro 在无人帮助下两小时内完成“博士级”数学研究","originalTitle":"","summary":"菲尔兹奖得主蒂莫西·高尔斯让 ChatGPT 5.5 Pro 尝试解决数论中的开放性问题。该模型在不到一小时内，将一个问题中的指数界限改进为多项式界限。一位参与的 MIT 研究员认为其核心想法“完全具有原创性”。高尔斯总结指出，未来数学贡献的门槛将变为证明某些是大语言模型无法完成的工作。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmoyh118d09uqsllhfwv7ggxu","originalUrl":"https://the-decoder.com/fields-medalist-says-chatgpt-5-5-pro-delivered-phd-level-math-research-in-under-two-hours-with-zero-human-help","publishedAt":"2026-05-10T00:00:00.605Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1uslcxv","originalSourceName":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","family":"outlet-ezirzi","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmoyh118d09uqsllhfwv7ggxu","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T10:49:04.201Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1uslcxv","name":"The Decoder：AI News（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T10:49:04.201Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"菲尔兹奖得主蒂莫西·高尔斯让 ChatGPT 5.5 Pro 尝试解决数论中的开放性问题。该模型在不到一小时内，将一个问题中的指数界限改进为多项式界限。一位参与的 MIT 研究员认为其核心想法“完全具有原创性”。高尔斯总结指出，未来数学贡献的门槛将变为证明某些是大语言模型无法完成的工作。","reportEdition":"2026-05-10","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmoyoyzpa0bjxsllhin4zx9ys","title":"OncoAgent：一个用于隐私保护肿瘤临床决策支持的双层多智能体框架","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-05-10T00:00:00.605Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmoyoyzpa0bjxsllhin4zx9ys","https://huggingface.co/blog/lablab-ai-amd-developer-hackathon/oncoagent-official-paper"],"articles":[{"id":"cmoyoyzpa0bjxsllhin4zx9ys","title":"OncoAgent：一个用于隐私保护肿瘤临床决策支持的双层多智能体框架","originalTitle":"","summary":"研究团队发布了开源肿瘤临床决策支持系统OncoAgent。该系统采用双层多智能体框架，结合LangGraph拓扑与四阶段Corrective RAG流程，检索超过70份权威临床指南。系统根据查询复杂度，将任务路由至9B参数的速度优化模型或27B参数的深度推理模型，两者均通过QLoRA在AMD MI300X硬件上使用包含26万余病例的数据集进行微调。系统强制执行严格的零受保护健康信息政策，并通过三层反射安全验证器确保安全，支持完全本地部署以保护患者数据主权。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmoyoyzpa0bjxsllhin4zx9ys","originalUrl":"https://huggingface.co/blog/lablab-ai-amd-developer-hackathon/oncoagent-official-paper","publishedAt":"2026-05-10T00:00:00.605Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-rb89q4","originalSourceName":"Hugging Face 社区博客（混合发现）","family":"outlet-1ohup8a","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"论文研究","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmoyoyzpa0bjxsllhin4zx9ys","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-05T10:49:04.201Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-rb89q4","name":"Hugging Face 社区博客（混合发现）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-05T10:49:04.201Z"}],"sectionLabel":"论文研究","reportSummary":"研究团队发布了开源肿瘤临床决策支持系统OncoAgent。该系统采用双层多智能体框架，结合LangGraph拓扑与四阶段Corrective RAG流程，检索超过70份权威临床指南。系统根据查询复杂度，将任务路由至9B参数的速度优化模型或27B参数的深度推理模型，两者均通过QLoRA在AMD MI300X硬件上使用包含26万余病例的数据集进行微调。系统强制执行严格的零受保护健康信息政策，并通过三层反射安全验证器确保安全，支持完全本地部署以保护患者数据主权。","reportEdition":"2026-05-10","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmoync8ty0b7dsllhsql34ns8","tit